      "locator": "Perplexity of fixed-length models；Calculating PPL with fixed-length models；target_ids context mask",
      "excerpt": "Perplexity is defined as the exponentiated average negative log-likelihood of a sequence.",
      "inspection_note": "已讀平均負條件對數機率公式、tokenization 影響、固定 context 與滑動視窗說明及 -100 遮罩範例；不採用該範例的模型內部 shift 計數為本專案契約。"
