      "locator": "bits_per_byte；weighted_mean",
      "excerpt": "def bits_per_byte(items):\n    return -weighted_mean(items) / math.log(2)\n\n\n@re\ndef weighted_mean(items):\n    a, b = zip(*items)\n    return sum(a) / sum(b)\n\n\nde",
      "inspection_note": "BPB 以總 log-likelihood／總 byte 權重，再除以 ln(2)；越低越好。"
    },
