      "locator": "math.log(x[, base])",
      "excerpt": ".. function:: log(x[, base])\n\n   With one argument, return the natural logarithm of *x* (to base *e*).\n\n   With two arguments, return the ",
      "inspection_note": "單參數 log 使用自然對數；與本機 Python 版本相同。"
    },
